{
  "type": "doc",
  "id": "{{id}}"
}

If this new page is itself a brand-new Early Access feature (not a new EA
section added to an existing page -- see style-guide.md's "Early Access
features" section for that case), add customProps.badge instead:

{
  "type": "doc",
  "id": "{{id}}",
  "customProps": {
    "badge": "Early Access"
  }
}
